The string representation of Date and Offset, if applicable.
DateOnly : {mm/dd/yyyy}
TimeOnly : {hh:mm:ss tt}
Date : {mm/dd/yyyy hh:mm:ss tt}
TimestampOffset : {mm/dd/yyyy hh:mm:ss.fff tt (+/-)hh:mm}
